## Mutation Analysis

The mutation is on line 81, changing `+` to `-` in the else branch of the kernel:

Original:
```cpp
for (int i = 0; i < VEC_SIZE && idx + i < size; i++) {
    output[idx + i] = softplus_activation<scalar_t, VEC_SIZE>(input[idx + i], beta);
}
```

Mutated:
```cpp
for (int i = 0; i < VEC_SIZE && idx - i < size; i++) {
    output[idx + i] = softplus_activation<scalar_t, VEC_SIZE>(input[idx + i], beta);
}
```

The change is in the loop condition: `idx + i < size` became `idx - i < size`.

